Calliope examples
-----------------
The national-scale and urban-scale example models and their data originate
from the Calliope project and its contributors, under Apache-2.0. Their
licenses, version references and provenance records accompany the examples.
See examples/README.md and examples/calliope-0.7.0-glpk/README.md.

Pfenninger, S. and Pickering, B. (2018). Calliope: a multi-scale energy systems
modelling framework. Journal of Open Source Software, 3(29), 825.
https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.00825

Ontology resources
------------------
The bundled OntoCal draft imports the unchanged OEO 2.12.0 merged release,
including the foundational vocabulary distributed with that release. It has
no PROV-O import. The upstream ontology header, OEO's CC0 notice, citation,
reuse record and source checksums are retained under
calliomapper/resources/dependencies. Consult those records for the relevant
contributions and terms. OntoCal's local additions are not an upstream OEO
release. docs/dependencies.md explains the representation and its limits.
